<codeline><highlight class="normal">\image<sp/>html<sp/>ccs_content_assist.jpg<sp/>&quot;CCS<sp/>Content<sp/>Assist<sp/>feature&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">If<sp/>you<sp/>can\&apos;t<sp/>tell<sp/>what<sp/>an<sp/>appropriate<sp/>parameter<sp/>is<sp/>just<sp/>from<sp/>looking<sp/>at<sp/>the<sp/>function</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">prototype<sp/>and<sp/>the<sp/>Content<sp/>Assist<sp/>list,<sp/>hover<sp/>over<sp/>the<sp/>function<sp/>to<sp/>view<sp/>its<sp/>description.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">CCS<sp/>Outline<sp/>View</highlight></codeline>
