<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">With<sp/>a<sp/>driver<sp/>header<sp/>file<sp/>open,<sp/>it<sp/>is<sp/>useful<sp/>to<sp/>take<sp/>advantage<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>CCS<sp/>Outline</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">view<sp/>to<sp/>get<sp/>a<sp/>complete<sp/>list<sp/>of<sp/>functions,<sp/>enumerations,<sp/>and<sp/>macros.<sp/>The<sp/>Outline</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">view<sp/>can<sp/>be<sp/>opened<sp/>by<sp/>selecting<sp/>Window<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>Show<sp/>view<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>Outline.<sp/>The<sp/>figure</highlight></codeline>
